                .type(NotificationType.COLLECTION)
                .build()
        );
    }

    @Test
    void testNotifyTwoProfilesFromOneCollectionAddition() {
        PigeonProfile clan = collectionProfile(
            "Clan", true, "", "Clan: %ITEM% (%COMPLETED%)", "https://example.com/clan");
        PigeonProfile friends = collectionProfile(
            "Friends", true, "", "Friends: %ITEM% (%COMPLETED%)", "https://example.com/friends");
        PigeonProfile filtered = collectionProfile(
            "Filtered", true, "Seercull", "Filtered", "https://example.com/filtered");
        PigeonProfile disabled = collectionProfile(
            "Disabled", false, "", "Disabled", "https://example.com/disabled");
        mockStoredProfiles(clan, friends, filtered, disabled);

        String item = "Seercull";
        when(itemSearcher.findItemId(item)).thenReturn(ItemID.DAGANOTH_CAVE_MAGIC_SHORTBOW);
        mockItem(ItemID.DAGANOTH_CAVE_MAGIC_SHORTBOW, 23_000, item);
        notifier.onChatMessage("New item added to your collection log: " + item);

        ArgumentCaptor<PigeonConfig> configs = ArgumentCaptor.forClass(PigeonConfig.class);
        ArgumentCaptor<String> urls = ArgumentCaptor.forClass(String.class);
        ArgumentCaptor<NotificationBody> bodies = ArgumentCaptor.forClass(NotificationBody.class);
        verify(messageHandler, times(2)).createMessage(
            configs.capture(), urls.capture(), anyBoolean(), bodies.capture());

        org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertEquals(
            List.of("https://example.com/clan", "https://example.com/friends"), urls.getAllValues());
        org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertEquals(
            "Clan: Seercull (1)", bodies.getAllValues().get(0).getText().evaluate(false));
        org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertEquals(
            "Friends: Seercull (1)", bodies.getAllValues().get(1).getText().evaluate(false));
    }

